<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle trade slow at $63-USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle trade slow at $63-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was slow in the Panhandle area early Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 400 slaughter heifers after a weekly movement of 131,700 head.</p>
<p>Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink. Slaughter Heifers - Few Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1100 lbs 63.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed - 400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
